theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 35
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][font_size=20](Amazing intro guitar riff plays as Miracle Machine walks into center stage)[/font_size]
Way back when I was just a little bitty boy,
Living in a box underneath the stairs in the corner of the basement of the house half a block down the street from Jerry's Bait shop,
[font_size=20]y'know the place,[/font_size]
Well anyway, back then life was going swell and everything was juuuuuuuust [b][i]PEACHY!!![/i][/b]
Except, of course, for the undeniable fact that, every single morning, my mom would make me a big bowl of [i]sauerkraut[/i] for breakfast.
[b][i]DHOOOOOW-[/i][/b]
[font_size=50]BIG BOWL OF SAURKRAUT![/font_size]
[font_size=20](pause for effect and guitar riff)[/font_size]
[font_size=50]EVERY SINGLE MORNING![/font_size]
[i]It was driving me crazy![/i]

So one day I said to my mom, \"Hey mom, what's up with all the sauerkraut?\"
And my dear, sweet mother,
She just stared at me like a cow stares at an oncoming train,
And she leaned right down next to me,
And she said...
[font_size=50]Ĭ̴͠T̶́̓'̷̛̚S̴̀́ ̶̀̀G̷̐̓O̸͂OD ̶̾͊FOR YOOOUUU!!![/font_size]
And then she tied me to the wall,
And stuck a funnel in my mouth,
And force fed me nothing but sauerkraut until I was 26 and 1/2 years old!"
fit_content = true
